        178.3273999999999
      ],
      "text_raw": "The quiescent current in the output devices is not that well defined. The variation of this\ncurrent is decreased by the local feedback of resistor R . However, it will never be really\nsh\nindependent of the supply or output voltage.",
      "text": "The quiescent current in the output devices is not that well defined. The variation of this current is decreased by the local feedback of resistor R . However, it will never be really sh independent of the supply or output voltage."
